# CODEOWNERS
# This file defines who should review PRs for specific parts of the codebase
# Lines starting with '#' are comments
# Each line is a file pattern followed by one or more owners
#
# IMPORTANT: Replace @GITHUB-ADMIN with your actual GitHub username(s)

# Default owners for everything in the repo
# These users will be requested for review when someone opens a pull request
*       @GITHUB-ADMIN

# Governance and legal documents require board review
/documents/                     @GITHUB-ADMIN
privacy.html                    @GITHUB-ADMIN
board.html                      @GITHUB-ADMIN

# GitHub configurations
/.github/                       @GITHUB-ADMIN

# Documentation
*.md                           @GITHUB-ADMIN

# You can add additional collaborators as they join:
# Example:
# *.html                        @GITHUB-ADMIN @another-collaborator
# *.css                         @designer-username
# *.js                          @developer-username
